\n4. **Solve for \\( c \\).**\n\nSubtract 5 from both sides:\n\\[\n1 - 5 = 2c\n\\]\n\\[\n-4 = 2c\n\\]\n\nDivide both sides by 2:\n\\[\nc = -2\n\\]\n\nThus, the solution for \\( c \\) is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{-2}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{-2}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"algebra:1053"}
